    {
      "id": 901,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 900],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 42,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Motion: move a photo with the motion of a clip on LTX 2.3",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Motion: move a photo with the motion of a clip on LTX 2.3\n\nRenders the person in your photo making the movements of your clip, on LTX 2.3 22B distilled with its union control IC-LoRA. SDPose draws the pose of the one person RT-DETR finds in each frame of the clip, and that pose guide drives the IC-LoRA. Your photo is the first frame, so the face, the clothes and the scene come from your photo. The video has the clip's frame count and frame rate, and carries the clip's sound when Keep the clip's sound is on. Built from Comfy's template video_ltx2_3_ic_lora, with its pose guide in place of its depth guide.\n\n## Models\n\n- [ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-fp8/resolve/main/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-fp8.safetensors): LTX 2.3 22B distilled, fp8, with its video and audio VAEs, [LTX-2 Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2).\n- [ltx-2.3-22b-ic-lora-union-control-ref0.5.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Union-Control/resolve/main/ltx-2.3-22b-ic-lora-union-control-ref0.5.safetensors): LTX 2.3 union control IC-LoRA, [LTX-2 Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2).\n- [gemma_3_12B_it_fp4_mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ltx-2/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/gemma_3_12B_it_fp4_mixed.safetensors): Gemma 3 12B text encoder, fp4, [Gemma Terms of Use](https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms).\n- [sdpose_wholebody_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SDPose/resolve/main/checkpoints/sdpose_wholebody_fp16.safetensors): SDPose whole body, [MIT on its card](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SDPose).\n- [rt_detr_v4-x-hgnet_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SDPose/resolve/main/diffusion_models/rt_detr_v4-x-hgnet_fp16.safetensors): RT-DETR v4 person detector, [the card of the repository it sits in](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SDPose).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
